+    value_count: int,
+    slot_count: int,
+    reload_offsets: set[int],
+) -> bool:
+    """Use only bounds-proven frozen slot facts as negative evidence.
+
+    Unknown IDs or records keep the ordinary liveness walk.  In particular,
+    do not inspect candidate types or project instruction data here: their
+    original admission paths own diagnostics and type interning.
